WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.183
A complete sentence needs an understandable subject and predicate; writing should be

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:06.429
clear and consistent.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:11.486
What is the subject of “The pupils planted maize”? Answer: The pupils

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:16.804
Copy a paragraph neatly and mark each sentence's subject and predicate.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.795
Discuss why: The subject names who performed the action.
